{"est_no":"167-31740","est_id":"8950","name":"Butler Elementary School","est_type":"School","address":"1701 S. MacArthur Blvd.","city":"Springfield","state":"IL","zip":"62704","visits":[{"id":"742375","date":"2026-05-05","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=742375&INSPECTION_NN=742375","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":13,"title":"Food in good condition, safe, and unadulterated.","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-202.15","citation_text":"3-202.15 Package Integrity. FOOD packages shall be in good condition and protect the integrity of the contents so that the FOOD is not exposed to ADULTERATION or potential contaminants.\n\nA can was observed with a dent in the bottom seam. The PIC was shown and the situation discussed. Ensure that all cans are removed if there is a dent observed in any of the three seams (top, bottom or side) to protect consumers from possible botulism infections. The can was moved to discard to correct."}]},{"id":"606488","date":"2026-01-28","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=606488&INSPECTION_NN=606488","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"544466","date":"2025-05-02","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=544466&INSPECTION_NN=544466","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"543848","date":"2025-04-29","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=543848&INSPECTION_NN=543848","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":48,"title":"Warewashing facilities: installed, maintained, and used; test strips.","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"4-302.14","citation_text":"4-302.14 Sanitizing Solutions, Testing Devices. A test kit or other device that accurately measures the concentration in MG/L of SANITIZING solutions shall be provided.\n\nThe test strips in the facility for the quaternary ammonia sanitizer are observed to be discolored during this inspection. They were tested in a solution by the inspector alongside their own test strips and did not produce the color change needed. Heat and moisture damage were discussed as possible damage vectors with the PIC. A follow up is being set for 10 days to ensure new strips are acquired."}]},{"id":"531873","date":"2025-01-30","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=531873&INSPECTION_NN=531873","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":23,"title":"Proper date marking and disposition.","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-501.18(A)","citation_text":"3-501.18(A) Ready-to-Eat, Time/Temperature Control for Safety Food, Disposition. (A) A FOOD specified in 3-501.17(A) or (B) shall be discarded if it: (1) Exceeds the temperature and time combination specified in 3-501.17(A).\n\nA mostly empty gallon of milk has a manufacturers use by date of 1/29/25 and a facility date mark of 1-20. Today is day 10 since opening and one day over the manufacturers date. The PIC was shown and discarded the container during this inspection to correct the violation. Ensure that all TCS foods are discarded within seven days of opening and prior to the manufacturers use by date."}]},{"id":"501294","date":"2024-05-08","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=501294&INSPECTION_NN=501294","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"6-101.11: (A) Materials indoor shall be SMOOTH, durable, and EASILY CLEANABLE. Areas subject to moisture must be Nonabsorbent. \n\nThe wall above the three part sink has paint cracked and peeling away from the wall. Some small sections have broken off completely. The PIC is instructed to repair the paint prior to the next routine inspection.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"488196","date":"2024-01-26","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=488196&INSPECTION_NN=488196","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"454332","date":"2023-04-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=454332&INSPECTION_NN=454332","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":56,"title":"Adequate ventilation and lighting; designated areas used","repeat":false,"comment":"6-403.11: (A) Areas designated for EMPLOYEES to eat, drink, and use tobacco shall be located so that FOOD, EQUIPMENT, LINENS, and SINGLESERVICE and SINGLE-USE ARTICLES are protected from contamination. (B) Lockers or other suitable facilities shall be located in a designated room or area where contamination of FOOD, EQUIPMENT, UTENSILS, LINENS, and SINGLE-SERVICE and SINGLE-USE ARTICLES cannot occur. \n\nA coffee cup is observed on the prep counter during this inspection. PIC was consulted and the cup removed during this inspection to correct. Employee beverages should be stored away from food prep surfaces and include a lid/straw if in the kitchen to prevent hand/lip contact.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"443569","date":"2023-01-19","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=443569&INSPECTION_NN=443569","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"434719","date":"2022-10-13","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=434719&INSPECTION_NN=434719","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407014","date":"2022-01-19","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407014&INSPECTION_NN=407014","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"398324","date":"2021-10-05","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=398324&INSPECTION_NN=398324","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"381520","date":"2021-03-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=381520&INSPECTION_NN=381520","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"378417","date":"2021-02-01","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=378417&INSPECTION_NN=378417","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"368644","date":"2020-08-14","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=368644&INSPECTION_NN=368644","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"356275","date":"2020-02-10","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=356275&INSPECTION_NN=356275","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"342960","date":"2019-09-13","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=342960&INSPECTION_NN=342960","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":23,"title":"Proper date marking and disposition","repeat":false,"comment":"Observed an opened gallon of 2% milk without date labeling. CORRECTED- Discussed with PIC, who stated the milk was opened on Wednesday and applied the appropriate date marking.\n3-501.17  Food shall be clearly marked, at the time the original container is opened in a food establishment and if the food is held for more than 24 hours, to indicate the date or day by which the food shall be consumed on the premises, sold, or discarded, when held at a temperature of 41 deg F or less for a maximum of 7 days (not exceeding a manufacturer's use-by date). (Pf)\n\nObserved caesar dressing with a date mark of 8/28. CORRECTED- Discussed with PIC. Dressing was voluntarily discarded.","citation":"3-501.17","citation_text":"3-501.17 Food prepared and held in a food establishment for more than 24 hours must be clearly marked to indicate the date or day by which the food must be consumed on the premises, sold, or discarded when held at a temperature of 41°F or less for a maximum of 7 days."}]},{"id":"324274","date":"2019-02-26","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=324274&INSPECTION_NN=324274","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"311333","date":"2018-09-12","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=311333&INSPECTION_NN=311333","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"270675","date":"2018-03-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=270675&INSPECTION_NN=270675","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"251077","date":"2017-08-23","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8950&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=251077&INSPECTION_NN=251077","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"237124","date":